      "retweeted_tweet_id": null,
      "text": "While patrolling the Eastern Pacific, our AMO P-3 Long Range Tracker crew visually acquired a suspicious 45-foot panga with a blue hull, 4 outboard engines, 3 persons onboard, and multiple fuel canisters and unknown objects. Acting quickly, the crew relayed the vessel’s coordinates to our international partners. \n\nThanks to this teamwork, the vessel was intercepted, and 2,391 lbs. of cocaine were seized! \n\nTo those who think they can outrun the law: We will catch you. #BorderSecurity #MissionSuccess",
      "text_resolved": "While patrolling the Eastern Pacific, our AMO P-3 Long Range Tracker crew visually acquired a suspicious 45-foot panga with a blue hull, 4 outboard engines, 3 persons onboard, and multiple fuel canisters and unknown objects. Acting quickly, the crew relayed the vessel’s coordinates to our international partners. \n\nThanks to this teamwork, the vessel was intercepted, and 2,391 lbs. of cocaine were seized! \n\nTo those who think they can outrun the law: We will catch you. #BorderSecurity #MissionSuccess",
