      "text": "A Multi-Role Enforcement Aircraft conducting an Operation Vigilant Sentry patrol detected a target of interest off the coast of Freeport, Bahamas, heading toward Bimini. The vessel was identified as a center console with two outboard engines and two persons on board. The MEA crew shared this information that was relayed to the Royal Bahamian Defense Force resulting in the seizure of 341 lbs. of cocaine.",
